\">Electromagnetic Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Concentration\" title=\"Electromagnetic Concentration\">Electromagnetic Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Energizing\" title=\"Electromagnetic Energizing\">Electromagnetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo\">Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Heat_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Heat Absorption\">Absolute Heat Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Capacitor\" title=\"Heat Capacitor\">Heat Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Concentration\" title=\"Heat Concentration\">Heat Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Heat Conversion\">Heat Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Energizing\" title=\"Heat Energizing\">Heat Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Heat Dynamo\">Bio-Heat Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Light_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Light Absorption\">Absolute Light Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Capacitor\" title=\"Light Capacitor\">Light Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Concentration\" title=\"Light Concentration\">Light Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Conversion\" title=\"Light Conversion\">Light Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Energizing\" title=\"Light Energizing\">Light Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Photonic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Photonic Dynamo\">Bio-Photonic Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Nuclear Absorption\">Absolute Nuclear Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Capacitor\" title=\"Nuclear Capacitor\">Nuclear Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Concentration\" title=\"Nuclear Concentration\">Nuclear Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Conversion\" title=\"Nuclear Conversion\">Nuclear Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Energizing\" title=\"Nuclear Energizing\">Nuclear Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Infinitum\" title=\"Stamina Infinitum\">Stamina Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Infinitum\" title=\"Strength Infinitum\">Strength Infinitum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Solar_Energy\" title=\"Personal Solar Energy\">Personal Solar Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Light\" title=\"Personal Light\">Personal Light</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Accumulation\" title=\"Solar Accumulation\">Solar Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Concentration\" title=\"Solar Concentration\">Solar Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Regeneration\" title=\"Solar Regeneration\">Solar Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Attacks\" title=\"Solar Attacks\">Solar Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Capacitor\" title=\"Solar Capacitor\">Solar Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Conversion\" title=\"Solar Conversion\">Solar Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Energizing\" title=\"Solar Energizing\">Solar Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Empowerment\" title=\"Solar Empowerment\">Solar Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Pinnacle_Condition\" title=\"Pinnacle Condition\">Pinnacle Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Immunity\" title=\"Solar Immunity\">Solar Immunity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Temperature_Immunity\" title=\"Temperature Immunity\">Temperature Immunity</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Solar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Overload_Immunity\"